  "title": "Washington Trust Reports First Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "Washington Trust Bancorp, Inc. (Nasdaq: WASH; \"Washington Trust\" or the \"Corporation\"), today reported first quarter 2026 net income of $12.6 million, or $0.66 per diluted share, compared to $16.0 million, or $0.83 per diluted share, for the preceding quarter. Compared to the first quarter of 2025, net income was up by $421 thousand, or $0.03 per diluted share, on a GAAP basis, and was up by $838 thousand, or $0.05 per diluted share, on an adjusted (non-GAAP) basis. \"Washington Trust delivered s",
